1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,950
Salama, cun Malia cun! Ca tu ko pelo po ta pa sowa?
Hi, Maria! Will you come with me to the sea?

2
00:00:05,050 --> 00:00:09,080
Ka! Cu ta ka piya sowa. Cu tan ko pelo pi temo co?
Yes! I love the sea. When will we go?

3
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:11,450
Tan ki pelo pi solu sin pumeno.
We could go in a week.

4
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:14,460
Ca tan ko pelo po pelowe se culewe?
Will we go by car, or by plane?

5
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:20,590
Culewe ka kuwi, su peya pu to ka tawa. Cu tan ku pelo po pelowe!
The plane is fast, but it's expensive. Let's take the car!

6
00:00:20,690 --> 00:00:23,520
Poni! Cu ta ko puna kula sa suyu.
Great! I'll bring food and water.

7
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:25,490
Cu tan ko kana pi camo!
Then we'll sing on the road!

8
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:29,220
Cu pelo ti ko sama sulo. Tane, sawi!
This trip will be beautiful. Thanks, friend!

